    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Ask your audience what they really think – build custom survey forms right in the Gutenberg editor and start collecting insights.</strong></p>\n<h3>Why Survey Form Block?</h3>\n<p><strong>Survey Form Block</strong> lets you effortlessly craft bespoke surveys in Gutenberg. Engage your audience and glean valuable insights without leaving the block editor.</p>\n<p>Tailor your surveys with versatile customization options: pick from a variety of field types, adjust the block settings from the editor sidebar, and publish your survey on any post or page.</p>\n<h3>Free Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Field Type Selection:</strong> Choose from a variety of field types to build your survey.</li>\n<li><strong>Gutenberg Native:</strong> Add and configure the survey form like any other block.</li>\n<li><strong>Sidebar Settings:</strong> Customize the block from the right-side settings panel.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to Use</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the <strong>Survey Form Block</strong> plugin.</li>\n<li>In the Gutenberg editor, add the <strong>Survey Form</strong> block from the &#8220;Widgets&#8221; block category.</li>\n<li>Choose your field types and adjust settings from the right-side sidebar.</li>\n<li>Publish – your survey is live!</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Use Cases</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Audience Research:</strong> Learn what your readers want more of.</li>\n<li><strong>Customer Feedback:</strong> Gather opinions on products and services.</li>\n<li><strong>Event Planning:</strong> Collect preferences and responses from attendees.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Did you like this plugin? Have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:support@bplugins.com\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">b Blocks</a></strong> – Best gutenberg blocks collections for WordPress.</p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Best audio player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Best video player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – A fully-featured PDF Viewer Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/document-embedder\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Document Embedder</a></strong> – Best WordPress Document Embeder Plugin.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models on the webs.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Advanced Post Block</a></strong> – Best Post Display Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>From your WordPress dashboard (recommended):</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong>.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>&#8220;Survey Form Block&#8221;</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n<li>Add the <strong>Survey Form Block</strong> to any post or page in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Manual installation:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>Survey Form Block</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>).</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong> and click <strong>Upload Plugin</strong>.</li>\n<li>Choose the <strong><code>survey-form-block.zip</code></strong> file and click <strong>Install Now</strong>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"is%20survey%20form%20block%20free%3F\">\nIs Survey Form Block free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Survey Form Block is a free Gutenberg block plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20choose%20different%20field%20types%20for%20my%20survey%3F\">\nCan I choose different field types for my survey?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The block includes a field type selection so you can build your survey from a variety of field types.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F\">\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20the%20block%3F\">\nHow many times can I reuse the block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use the block an unlimited number of times.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F\">\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/survey-form-block/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2 &#8211; 8 April, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Wordfence problem has been solved;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1 &#8211; 25 April, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with WordPress 6.8;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0 &#8211;  13 Jan, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
